# SplitWise Lite Frontend Environment Variables
# When deployed together on Vercel via vercel.json, leave VITE_API_URL empty
# (API calls use relative paths "/api/..." and are proxied automatically).
#
# If you deploy the backend to a separate service (e.g. Render, Railway), set:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
